{"route":"/diagnostika_plotra/","title":"V akom technickom stave máte ploter? - HPplotre.sk","description":"Väčšina z nás túto otázku nerieši … zapneme stroj, odošleme výkres na tlač a hotovo. Ale čo ak… ploter nemá dostatočnú pamäť a nenačíta výkres, alebo vytlačené ","bodyClass":"post-template-default single single-post postid-21140 single-format-standard wp-theme-layerswp layers-header-sticky","css":"","html":"\n<div class=\"content-main clearfix post-21140 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-blog container\">\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <article id=\"post-21140\" class=\"column span-12\">\n      <header class=\"section-title large\"><h5 class=\"meta-info\"><p><span class=\"meta-item meta-date\"><i class=\"l-clock-o\"></i> 25. marca 2025</span></p></h5><h1 class=\"heading\">V akom technickom stave máte ploter?</h1></header>\n      <div class=\"thumbnail push-bottom\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/servis.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"story\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Väčšina z&nbsp;nás túto otázku nerieši &#8230; zapneme stroj, odošleme výkres na tlač a hotovo.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:37% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-19513 size-full\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-300x225.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-768x576.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-1536x1153.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2022/03/IMG-20220128-WA0001-rotated.jpg 1599w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#008080\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Ale čo ak&#8230;</mark></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ploter nemá dostatočnú pamäť a nenačíta výkres, alebo vytlačené čiary nie sú ostré,&nbsp;pretrhne sa remeň, alebo ako v&nbsp;prípade na videu /nižšie/ nefunguje dotykový displej a&nbsp;pod?</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#008080\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Plánujete expedovať projekt?</mark></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\">Buďte pripravení a minimálne si vopred otestujte tlač a&nbsp;skontrolujte objem náplní.<br>Ak si nie ste istí stavom plotra, náš technik Vám ho môže prísť skontrolovať.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vyše 16 rokov servisujeme plotre a&nbsp;vieme, že v&nbsp;zásade sa pokazia v&nbsp;najnevhodnejšiu chvíľu.<br>Včasnou diagnostikou tak predídete možným problémom s tlačou.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/diagnostika-plotra/\" style=\"background-color:#008080\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Chcem si objednať diagnostiku plotra</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/vymena-displeja-FINAL.mp4\"></video></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n</div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</div>","sliders":{}}